# MeterWorklog — Project Context for Claude

## Overview
Team Worklog Management web app. Members log daily work (project, task, hours, status). Leaders/Admins review dashboards and export Excel reports.

---

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| Backend | Python Flask 3.1.0 |
| Database | MS SQL Server (SQLEXPRESS) via pyodbc |
| ORM/Query | Custom `db.py` wrapper (raw SQL) |
| Frontend | Vanilla JavaScript + Tailwind CSS v2.2.19 CDN |
| Excel Export | openpyxl 3.1.5 |
| Production Server | waitress 3.0.2 |
| External Tunnel | ngrok (optional) |
| Auth | Flask session + werkzeug password hashing |

**Tailwind version note:** Using CDN v2.2.19 — `cyan` color palette is NOT available. Use `style="background:#22d3ee"` or `bg-green-600` for teal/cyan-like colors instead of `bg-cyan-*`.

