│       ├── calendar.js      # Calendar view
│       ├── export.js        # Month filter + Excel download
│       ├── settings.js      # Members / projects / users tabs
│       └── files.js         # File Share UI (tree, upload, download, delete, stats)
├── templates/
│   ├── index.html           # Main SPA with Files tab + new-folder modal
│   ├── login.html           # Login + Register page
│   └── Monthly_Worklog_Template.xlsx  # Excel template — CRITICAL: must have 'empty' sheet
└── storage/
    └── files/               # Blob store: YYYY/MM/<uuid>.bin (NOT served by static)
```

---

## Database Schema

### `members`
| Column | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| id | INT PK | |
| name | NVARCHAR | |
| department | NVARCHAR | |
| staff_id | NVARCHAR | nullable |
| position | NVARCHAR | nullable |

### `projects`
| Column | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| id | INT PK | |
| name | NVARCHAR UNIQUE | |
| main_members | NVARCHAR(MAX) | member names joined by ` #` delimiter |
| support_members | NVARCHAR(MAX) | member names joined by ` #` delimiter |

Project member assignment stores **member names** (not IDs) concatenated with ` #` as delimiter.
Parse with: `[n.strip() for n in col_val.split('#') if n.strip()]`

### `worklogs`
| Column | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| id | INT PK | |
| member_id | INT FK | → members |
| log_date | DATE | |
| project | NVARCHAR | project name string |
| task | NVARCHAR | |
| start_time | TIME | nullable |
| end_time | TIME | nullable |
| hours | computed | `DATEDIFF(MINUTE, start_time, end_time) / 60.0` |
| status | NVARCHAR | CHECK: 'Done', 'In Progress', 'Pending' |
| note | NVARCHAR | nullable |

### `users`
| Column | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| id | INT PK | |
| username | NVARCHAR UNIQUE | |
| password_hash | NVARCHAR | werkzeug generated |
| role | NVARCHAR | CHECK: see roles below |
| member_id | INT FK | → members, nullable (admin accounts may have no member) |
| status | NVARCHAR(20) | CHECK: 'Pending', 'Active', 'Declined'. New self-registrations land as `Pending`; existing rows are migrated to `Active`. |
| reviewed_by | INT FK users, nullable | Approver / decliner |
| reviewed_at | DATETIME2 nullable | Decision timestamp |

**Account approval flow:** `/api/register` → user inserted with `status='Pending'`. `/api/login` checks status AFTER password verification (no enumeration leak): `Pending` → 403 `pending_approval`; `Declined` → 403 `declined`. Elevated roles (Admin/Leader/Super_Ultimate_ADMIN) approve via `POST /api/users/<uid>/approve` or decline via `POST /api/users/<uid>/decline`. Declined accounts are kept (audit) — never auto-deleted.

### `file_folders` (File Share)
| Column | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| id | INT PK | |
| name | NVARCHAR(200) | |
| parent_id | INT FK self, nullable | NULL = root; self-referencing tree |
| created_by | INT FK users, nullable | |
| created_at | DATETIME2 | default GETDATE() |

`UNIQUE (parent_id, name)` — no sibling folders with the same name.
Seed row: `('Shared', NULL)` — the default landing folder.

### `files` (File Share metadata)
| Column | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| id | INT PK | |
| folder_id | INT FK file_folders, nullable | NULL = root |
| original_name | NVARCHAR(400) | display + download name |
| stored_name | NVARCHAR(200) UNIQUE | `YYYY/MM/<uuid>.bin` — NEVER user input |
| size_bytes | BIGINT | |
| mime_type | NVARCHAR(200) | nullable |
| sha256 | CHAR(64) | nullable |
| uploaded_by | INT FK users, nullable | |
| uploaded_at | DATETIME2 | default GETDATE() |

Blobs live under `FILE_STORAGE_DIR` (default `storage/files/`). Path is resolved with `os.path.realpath` and re-checked against the base dir on every download (path-traversal defense).

---

## Role System

```python
ROLE_SUPER_ADMIN = 'Super_Ultimate_ADMIN'   # Full access: user mgmt, role changes
ROLE_ADMIN       = 'Admin'                  # Elevated: members, projects, all worklogs
ROLE_LEADER      = 'Leader'                 # Elevated: members, projects, all worklogs
ROLE_STAFF       = 'Staff'                  # Own worklogs + own project assignments only

ELEVATED_ROLES   = (ROLE_SUPER_ADMIN, ROLE_ADMIN, ROLE_LEADER)
ASSIGNABLE_ROLES = (ROLE_ADMIN, ROLE_LEADER, ROLE_STAFF)  # Super admin can assign these
```

**Permission rules:**
- Staff: can only edit/delete their own worklogs, can only assign themselves to projects
- Elevated: can manage any member's worklogs and project assignments
- Admin (Super_Ultimate_ADMIN only): change user roles, reset passwords for others
- Super admin cannot be deleted or have role changed

