## API Routes

### Auth
| Method | Route | Auth | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET | `/login` | None | Login page |
| POST | `/api/login` | None | Returns role + member_id |
| POST | `/api/register` | None | Creates member + Staff user |
| POST | `/api/logout` | login | |
| GET | `/api/me` | login | Current user info |

### Members
| Method | Route | Auth | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET | `/api/members` | login | All members |
| POST | `/api/members` | elevated | Create member |
| PUT | `/api/members/<mid>` | elevated | Update member |
| DELETE | `/api/members/<mid>` | elevated | Fails if linked to user |
| GET | `/api/members/<mid>/project-roles` | login | Returns `{main:[{id,name}], support:[{id,name}]}` |

### Projects
| Method | Route | Auth | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET | `/api/projects` | login | |
| POST | `/api/projects` | elevated | |
| DELETE | `/api/projects/<pid>` | elevated | |
| POST | `/api/projects/<pid>/assign` | login | Body: `{member_id, type}` type='main'\|'support' |
| POST | `/api/projects/<pid>/unassign` | login | Body: `{member_id, type}` |

### Worklogs
| Method | Route | Auth | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET | `/api/worklogs` | login | Params: member_id, year, month |
| POST | `/api/worklogs` | login | Staff forced to own member_id |
| PUT | `/api/worklogs/<wid>` | login | Staff can only edit own |
| DELETE | `/api/worklogs/<wid>` | login | Staff can only delete own |

### Dashboard & Export
| Method | Route | Auth | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET | `/api/dashboard` | login | Params: member_id, year |
| GET | `/api/export/excel` | login | Params: member_id, year, months (csv ints) |
| GET | `/api/export/excel/bulk` | elevated | Params: member_ids (csv), year, months (csv ints) |

### File Share
| Method | Route | Auth | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET | `/api/files/tree` | login | Full nested folder tree |
| GET | `/api/files/folder` | login | Root listing: `{breadcrumbs, subfolders, files}` |
| GET | `/api/files/folder/<fid>` | login | Listing for folder `<fid>` |
| POST | `/api/files/folder` | login | Create folder — body `{name, parent_id}` |
| PUT | `/api/files/folder/<fid>` | creator OR elevated | Rename |
| DELETE | `/api/files/folder/<fid>` | creator OR elevated | Must be empty |
| POST | `/api/files/upload` | login | multipart; form `folder_id` (optional). 413 = too big, 507 = storage full |
| GET | `/api/files/<fid>/download` | login | `send_file` with original_name + RFC 5987 header |
| DELETE | `/api/files/<fid>` | uploader OR elevated | Removes DB row + blob |
| GET | `/api/files/stats` | login | `{total_bytes, cap_bytes, free_bytes, file_count, pct_used}` |

